 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-choose-a-daily-weekly-or-monthly-aeo-prompt-tracking-rhythm"&gt;How to Choose a Daily, Weekly, or Monthly AEO Prompt-Tracking Rhythm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-to-reduce-noise-and-confirm-trends-in-aeo-prompt-tracking"&gt;How to Reduce Noise and Confirm Trends in AEO Prompt Tracking&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
